  "description": "<p>Twinklette is a business that was started simply to make personalized blankets for my own children.&nbsp; My children love having things personalized with their own interests and favorite colors. They also love having sleepovers, building forts, snuggling on the couch and spending lots of time on the sports fields!! We combined our love for sports and blankets! We started designing blankets and they were having so much fun with it that we decided to start selling them. We hope that you like them just as much as we do!</p>\r\n<p>My children LOVE the minky blankets. They use them to lounge on the couch, sleep with, make forts, and take to the fields. They are very soft and come in three sizes. The sherpa blankets are heavier and print vivid images. My children use their sherpa blankets for their beds instead of a comforter.</p>\r\n<p>The minky sports blankets have been our best sellers so far!&nbsp; We are also starting to design beach towels and other personalized items as well.</p>",
